            "data": {
                "label": "Activity During Shutdown",
                "sequence": "0",
                "user_properties": [
                    [
                        "rdfs:comment",
                        "While the mainlines remained down CPC operated\nsome lateral lines.\n\n\nDuring this they learned that there was not enough\nwritten documentation of manual or low tech operating\nprocedures and were reliant on older employees\nwho had operated prior to heavy automation for\nsection operation.\n"
                    ]
                ]
            },
