        },
        {
            "id": "0.1739115285623688",
            "type": "note-node",
            "position": {
                "x": -3004.420618363362,
                "y": -4128.870362341719
            },
            "data": {
                "label": "Initial Access",
                "sequence": "0",
                "user_properties": [
                    [
                        "rdfs:comment",
                        "Malicious cyber actors acquired employee user credentials \nfor a VPN service externally.The employee had used the\n\ncredentials for an external service from where they are\n\nsuspected to have gotten.\n\n\nThe MCAs then gained access to the IT network through\n\nthe VPN service, which was thought to be out of service\nand not properly monitored.\n\n\n\nOnce in the system the MCAs deployed DarkSide ransomware\nand locked down the corporate IT system.\n"
                    ]
                ]
            },
            "measured": {
                "width": 345,
                "height": 210
            },
            "selected": false,
            "dragging": false,
            "width": 321,
            "height": 210
        },
        {
            "id": "0.601359170494683",
            "type": "note-node",
            "position": {
                "x": -892.1088944371041,
                "y": -4230.124593969633
            },
            "data": {
                "label": "Pipeline Restart",
                "sequence": "0",
                "user_properties": [
                    [
                        "rdfs:comment",
                        "CPS paid the ransom and eventually were able\n\nto initiate restart on may11th, fully restarting\n\noperations on may 12th.\n\n\n\nDespite paying for the key CPC stated that it\ndid not fully undo what had been done and they\ncontinued to work on their systems and reevaluate\n\nsome policies.\n\n\nCPC cooperated with the authorities during this\n\nincident aside from when they went out of contact\nin advance of paying the ransom against FBI\n\nrecommendation.\n"
                    ]
                ]
            },
            "measured": {
                "width": 279,
